- Failed candidate refreshes preserve the last known-good snapshot.
- Added refresh tests for single-fetch behavior, freshness, rejection safety and invalid policy configuration.
- Upstox instrument keys remain the canonical identifier; raw broker-specific records are not exposed to domain services.
- No credentials or live execution added; PAPER remains the default.

